      "content": "okay but i'm really trying to avoid the hospital if i can, the copays are insane and honestly i just feel okay otherwise. if it's just bell's palsy, can't i just take some steroids or something at home and wait a few days to see if it goes away? i'd rather just deal with it here than deal with an er visit if it's nothing serious. what do you think?",
